35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mess. The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The invoices show separate licenses climbing yearly. Bundled ones stayed flat.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. Four suppliers, no one in charge.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. The 2018 data lift had errors for a year.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Two admins retire this year. The last posting was open for eleven months.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, so the modular approach might be cheaper? Or is it a trap?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, it depends. If we buy separate pieces, costs rise. If bundled, they hold.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the upgrade history is scary. We can't afford to skip windows again.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, yes. And the data lift shows external teams can mess up the basics.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the depot calendar is tight. We have no freeze window in winter.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need something that fits our current hardware. No major upgrades needed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I prefer a bundled subscription. It keeps the operating costs predictable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I need a single point of contact for support. No more pointing fingers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I want a system that doesn't age quietly. It needs regular, manageable updates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The training must be simple. Our supervisors drop standard steps if they are complex.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
