60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Candidate C, Anchor, is built for transport and on our servers. That fits our yard.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate A, Tessera, is a subscription. That matches my cost concerns.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate D, Meridian, has a regional service team. That solves the ownership issue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Candidate B, Corvus, is modular. But we saw how separate pieces fail.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Candidate C has an engineering team present. That helps with our staff shortage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, but Anchor is on-premise. Will the costs be high?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, on-premise means we own the hardware. But the license might be fixed.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, Corvus is too risky. We don't want to manage four separate components.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, agreed. The 2018 data lift shows external teams can be unreliable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, Anchor's team is present. That is good for the depot supervisors.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am leaning towards Anchor. It fits our specific needs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I am torn. Tessera is cheaper long-term, but Anchor is safer for operations.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Meridian. The regional team ensures someone is always in charge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I vote for Anchor. It is built for us, and the team is here to help.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for Anchor. The on-site support is crucial for our thin staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
